        // symbol's TV island). For the 212 imports whose island lies beyond A5+0x7FFF (tv>=2304), that u16
        // is written verbatim but a `jsr (d16,A5)` reads d16 SIGNED, so 0x3800+8*tv WRAPS to a negative
